Changelog: 28-10-2026 17:14:56

Release 1.2.0.

Changelog: 28-10-2026 17:10:34

Added. After an install started by hand from a download, install.ps1 asks whether to remove the download: the zip,
its SHA256SUMS (also one saved as SHA256SUMS (1)) and the unpacked folder (owner, 28-10-2026: a second download
was saved as SHA256SUMS (1), and the check read the old one). Never asked when the portal runs the installer. The
README's steps run install.ps1 from the download folder instead of cd into the unpacked one, so it can go.

Changelog: 28-10-2026 17:00:55

Fixed. install.ps1 puts the new program in place before the old one goes: it renames the program folder, or,
while a window has the folder as its working directory, moves its contents, where it deleted the files first and
then could not remove the folder, which left no program (owner, 28-10-2026: seen with the portal's update). A
program still running from the folder is refused with nothing changed.

