Changelog: 28-10-2026 16:14:41

Release 1.1.0.

Changelog: 28-10-2026 16:12:59

Added. The Controller card says that the back buttons M1 and M2 answer only once Armoury Crate maps them to a
button (Settings, Configure): by default they are its modifiers and Windows never sees them (owner, 28-10-2026).

Changelog: 28-10-2026 16:10:21

Fixed. The controller test shows the Menu button as ☰, the symbol on the Ally, instead of the word Menu (owner,
28-10-2026).

Changelog: 28-10-2026 15:59:38

Fixed. The Device card reads what Windows reports only when you press A (or tap Read), instead of as soon as the
app opens; after the first read the pill says Read again (owner, 28-10-2026, on the Ally).

Changelog: 28-10-2026 15:56:25

Fixed. A long value on the Device card (a driver or a screen name) wraps onto a second line instead of widening
the card's pane, which pushed the cards on the left narrower: the cards' column keeps its width (owner, 28-10-2026,
on the Ally).

