Release 1.0.0.

Changelog: 28-10-2026 00:48:41

Breaking. The program is Windows-Portable-Test.exe (EXE_NAME; owner, 28-10-2026), no longer Windows-PT.exe:
install.ps1 installs and the portal's apps.toml detects and opens the new name, so a portal pinning this release
does not find an older one installed until it is updated. The header's battery moved into core (bc250_core.power),
where the portal reads it too; nothing changes in the window.

