Changelog: 27-10-2026 21:47:38

Release 0.1.1.

Changelog: 27-10-2026 21:41:30

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 27-10-2026 17:53:45

Added. install.ps1 installs the app from its release (wp-test-v<x.y.z>.zip, unpacked) for your own user: the program
(Windows-PT.exe, EXE_NAME in the package; owner, 27-10-2026) in %LOCALAPPDATA%\windows-portable-suite\windows-portable-test\app, a Start-menu entry in the Windows Portable Suite
folder and a Desktop shortcut. It takes the suite's options: --no-desktop-shortcut, --uninstall (the settings, the
log and the reports stay), --uninstall --purge and --help, and refuses to run as administrator.

Changelog: 27-10-2026 17:02:23

Fixed. The header has no icon (owner, 27-10-2026: the screen is too small for it); the window icon stays. The main
pill takes core's new button color, #cd8b22 (a trial). The icon copies are written again from the suite's drawing.

Changelog: 26-10-2026 22:48:15

Added. Windows Portable Test, the Windows Portable Suite's test app (owner, 26-10-2026): what Windows reports about
the handheld (the device, processor, cores, graphics and its driver, the screen the window is on, memory installed
and usable, storage, Windows, the firmware and the battery), read in the background with one PowerShell query, and a
controller test that shows every button, stick and trigger as it is pressed and counts the buttons that answered
(hold B to finish). X saves the device report in the suite's folder. Built on core's portable window: full screen,
the controller and touch.
